# ── Rust ──
/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# ── Node / TypeScript SDK ──
node_modules/
package-lock.json
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Solidity / Foundry ──
contracts/out/
contracts/cache/
contracts/broadcast/
# `forge script --broadcast` writes deployment logs; keep the dry-run noise out
# but note that real deployment records are worth committing deliberately.

# ── Local runtime state ──
# Default storage dir from `peregrine config init`; holds the per-validator
# redb files written by `peregrine node run`.
/peregrine-data/
*.redb

# Local configuration is per-developer. Scaffold your own with
# `peregrine config init`; commit one deliberately if your deployment needs it.
/peregrine.toml

# ── Secrets ──
# `peregrine keygen --out` writes a raw ed25519 seed. Never commit one.
*.key
/keys/

# ── Editor / tooling ──
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Stale duplicate (safe to delete) ──
# `peregrine/` is an abandoned Week-1 copy of the scaffold: it has its own
# Cargo.toml, is NOT a workspace member, and contains none of the current
# crates. Excluded so it never reaches the public repo; deleting it from disk
# is recommended.
/peregrine/

# ── OS ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
